AB  - Dear Editor An article published in 2020 in this journal reported a rare case of 
      a young medical student presenting with low-grade mucoepidermoid carcinoma of the 
      central airway. Curative sleeve resection was done, with negative margins and no 
      evidence of lymph nodal involvement. The current letter presents a 3-year 
      follow-up of the same individual and a short review of the evidence available for 
      post-resection monitoring in such patients...
