AB  - The aim of this observation is to make cytologists aware of the identification of 
      melanoma cells in bronchial washings from an endobronchial metastasis of 
      malignant melanoma. CT scan and flexible bronchoscopy images are provided and 
      differential diagnosis and additional analyses (molecular biology) are mentioned 
      and discussed.
