TI  - Management of Significant Airway Bleeding during Robotic Assisted Bronchoscopy: A 
      Tailored Approach.
PG  - 547-550
LID - 10.1159/000514830 [doi]
AB  - Robotic assisted bronchoscopy represents a major turning point in bronchoscopic 
      history. The management strategies to address significant airway bleeding in this 
      "robotic era" are not well documented, and further guidance is required. We 
      present a case report that exemplifies our approach and management strategy using 
      a combined and simultaneous flexible/robotic bronchoscopy if this complication is 
      encountered.
