TI  - A 46-Year-Old Woman With a Mediastinal Mass.
PG  - e69-e73
LID - S0012-3692(19)34023-1 [pii]
LID - 10.1016/j.chest.2019.09.034 [doi]
AB  - A 46-year-old otherwise healthy woman visited the ED twice over a period of 
      4 days for chest discomfort, midback pain, and dyspnea. The pain was localized, 
      constant, nonpleuritic in nature, moderate in severity, and was not relieved by 
      over-the-counter medications.
