AB  - Metastatic pulmonary calcification is a rare disease characterized by calcium 
      deposits in the lung. We describe a case where this pathology is observed 
      associated with bone lithic lesions and kidney failure and it was diagnosed with 
      transbronchial cryobiopsy.
