AB  - In this review, we trace (i) the origins of bronchial thermoplasty, (ii) the 
      development of a solid evidence base for efficacy and safety, (iii) the emerging 
      understanding of the pathophysiological mechanisms of action and (iv) the place 
      in therapy today. Future challenges are then discussed.
