TI  - Exclusively Tracheobronchial Paracoccidioidomycosis: A Rare Presentation.
PG  - e499-e501
LID - S0012-3692(21)01355-6 [pii]
LID - 10.1016/j.chest.2021.06.077 [doi]
AB  - Paracoccidioidomycosis (PCM), or blastomycosis in South America, is a systemic 
      granulomatous mycosis related to activities associated with soil management, 
      especially agriculture. PCM restricted to tracheobronchial tree region has not 
      yet been reported.
