TI  - Tracheobronchopathia Osteochondroplastica: Five Cases Report and Literature 
      Review.
PG  - NP111-NP118
LID - 10.1177/0145561319897982 [doi]
AB  - Tracheobronchopathia osteochondroplastica (TO) is a rare disease. Here, we report 
      5 TO cases treated at our hospital. Bronchoscopy showed typical multiple firm and 
      glossy nodules in all the 5 cases. Conservative treatment effectively alleviated 
      the symptoms. Tracheobronchopathia osteochondroplastica is a manageable disease. 
      Awareness in clinicians is critical to avoid unnecessary treatment in patients 
      with TO.
