AB  - Foreign body aspiration can be an acute life-threatening emergency and, if left 
      untreated, can result in severe complications. Among Muslim women, the hijab pin 
      can be accidentally aspirated. The article describes standard management with 
      rigid bronchoscopy and a new technique involving magnets.
