TI  - Real-time image-guided electromagnetic navigation bronchoscopy dual-marker 
      technique to localize deep pulmonary nodules in a hybrid operating room.
PG  - i103-i105
LID - 10.1093/ejcts/ezz360 [doi]
AB  - Herein, we describe a Dyna-computed tomography-guided electromagnetic navigation 
      bronchoscopy technique aimed at localizing deep pulmonary nodules. The method was 
      implemented in a hybrid operating room and required the use of 2 markers (a 
      near-infrared dye as a surface marker and a microcoil as a deep marker).
